DATA NOTICE

All data in the data/ folder is synthetic and was generated for training.
Company, supplier, customer, plant and product names are used only to make the
scenario realistic. The figures do not describe, and must not be read as
describing, any real organisation, transaction or relationship. SAP and other
product names are trademarks of their respective owners; their use here does
not imply endorsement.

This material is provided for training. It is not a supported Snowflake product
and is not intended for production use.
